  "description": "Gary Tan revealed a prompt so powerful it literally broke the AI. As CEO of Y Combinator and an early backer of DoorDash, Instacart, and Airbnb, his insight highlights the crucial difference between partial and complete AI task execution. The core idea is that completing an AI task perfectly hinges on tiny, precise details—“three drops of water” that represent finishing without errors or postponing steps. This concept underscores the importance of thoroughness and zero tolerance for mistakes in AI workflows. This approach has significant implications for how AI systems are built and operated, emphasizing the refinement of prompts to achieve flawless, full completions. It offers a valuable strategy for startups and developers looking to maximize AI effectiveness and reliability. Comment \"prompt\" if you want to try the exact prompt yourself. #GaryTan #YCombinator #AIprompt #AIbreakthrough #DoorDash #Instacart #Airbnb #ArtificialIntelligence #StartupAccelerator #AIPrompts #TechInnovation #AICompletion #PromptEngineering #AIBusiness #AIInsights",
